{"id": "86223", "name": "צמצום שבר אלגברי – (av + k)/(bv) עם גורם משותף (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "igcd2", "params": ["p", "q"], "body": "if q=0 then abs(p) else igcd2(q,mod(p,q))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Reduce the following fraction to its lowest terms:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Factorise the numerator by taking out its common factor, then cancel the factor common to the numerator and the denominator.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Factorise the numerator</b><br>Both terms of the numerator are multiples of <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</span> (<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}={{CT:1}}\\cdot {{CT:3}}\\)</span>), so take it out as a common factor. By factorising the numerator we obtain:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{{CT:4}}{{CT:5}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Cancel the common number</b><br>The numerator and the denominator have the common factor <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\gcd({{CT:1}},{{CT:6}})={{CT:7}}\\)</span>. Then we can simplify the constants from the numerator and denominator to obtain:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:8}}. \\]</p>Nothing else cancels: the bracket <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left({{CT:9}}\\right)\\)</span> is a sum, and <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:10}}\\)</span> is not a factor of it.</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "SingleFrac", "sans": "ans", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "1-1-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "gcd(num(ans),denom(ans))", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-2-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-2-F ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer is not in its lowest terms but is otherwise correct.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["G", "cf1", "cf2", "f", "k1", "ta", "ta2", "v"], "nvariants": 50}